VALUES ('blur', 'Blur', 'Noa Reyes', 'Music · Single', '/covers/04.jpg', '/previews/04.mp3', '["tiktok","instagram"]', 350, 4000000, 'Nov 20', 'An intimate vocal-led single. The bridge is the hook. Emotional, personal edits over the track are what we are after.', '["Personal story edits using the bridge","Lyric-on-screen formats","Behind-the-scenes from the acoustic session"]', '["Comedic or meme formats","Covers of the song","Paid promotion of other products"]', 'live', 'sample', 1760054400, 1760054400, 1760054400);
